{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_05AD70","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"确认一下。你来哥斯达黎加是为了观鸟，对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"对。不过我好歹也是研究者，可不是来玩的。我在调查中南美洲的鸟类分布。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"有了轻便的卡带录音机之后，就算女人也能一个人搬着录音设备。不过，一个人来这里还是失策了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"原来如此。不过哥斯达黎加的野鸟还真多。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"是啊。据说哥斯达黎加有800多种鸟，占现存鸟类的10%以上。你认识多少种，鸟类学家先生？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"那是为了不吓到你……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"至少也该知道哥斯达黎加的基本常识吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"啊……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"那我就从头教你吧，新手鸟类学家先生。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"啊、嗯。那先告诉我凤尾绿咬鹃吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""}]}